#: ../../source/formats.md:19 02d8c183e2174a05a50fe757ae1078e2
msgid ""
"只想确认“我的 `.xyz` 能不能打开”时，先看文件首帧：原子数要与原子行一致；周期结构应有 有效 `Lattice`；逐原子列必须与 "
"`Properties` 声明一致。满足这些条件的普通 XYZ/EXTXYZ "
"可以直接尝试导入。失败时根据错误信息检查具体字段，不要用补零或伪元素绕过。"
msgstr ""
"To check whether an `.xyz` file can be opened, inspect its first frame: "
"the atom count must match the atom rows; periodic structures need a valid"
" `Lattice`; per-atom columns must match the `Properties` declaration. "
"Ordinary XYZ/EXTXYZ files meeting these conditions can be imported "
"directly. If import fails, inspect the named fields instead of padding "
"values or using fake elements."

#: ../../source/formats.md:24 8068186435a64e1fb4d579bb48be222f
msgid ""
"要继续生成新结构，进入 `构建数据集`；要看图、删结构、筛选或导出子集，进入 `NEP "
"数据集查看`。同一种文件在两个入口中的用途不同，但底层结构数据不会因为入口不同 自动增加 DFT 标签。"
msgstr ""
"To generate new structures, open `Make Dataset`; to view, delete, filter,"
" or export a subset, open `NEP Dataset Display`. The same file serves "
"different purposes in these two entry points, but the underlying data do "
"not gain DFT labels merely because the entry point changes."

