#: ../../source/formats.md:70 9294b9461d384742be030e98844a3f2f
msgid "训练结束后，把训练结构和这些输出一起导入 `NEP 数据集查看`，可以查看散点图、 定位误差最大的结构，并导出下一轮要处理的子集。"
msgstr ""
"After training, load the training structures together with these outputs "
"in `NEP Dataset Display`. You can inspect scatter plots, locate the "
"largest-error structures, and export a subset for the next iteration."

#: ../../source/formats.md:73 339006da539a4e539c788e26be532d0b
msgid "VASP"
msgstr "VASP"

#: ../../source/formats.md:75 5f5d7b9340f9407bb54f54962a01d73d
msgid "`OUTCAR`：读取晶胞、坐标、力、应力和 virial。"
msgstr "`OUTCAR`: reads the cell, coordinates, forces, stress, and virial."

#: ../../source/formats.md:76 28294c179b2e494c93261faace667512
msgid "`XDATCAR`：读取逐帧晶胞和坐标。"
msgstr "`XDATCAR`: reads the cell and coordinates for each frame."

#: ../../source/formats.md:78 214d4d8da04f4a9ca246610e3f983dd1
msgid "VASP 结果通常用于把 DFT 标注转成训练结构，或在 `NEP 数据集查看` 中检查标签质量。"
msgstr ""
"VASP results are commonly used to convert DFT labels into training "
"structures or to inspect label quality in `NEP Dataset Display`."

#: ../../source/formats.md:80 35af742b52c040348f540f1edfa32adf
msgid "高级结构格式"
msgstr "Advanced structure formats"

#: ../../source/formats.md:82 a321ae7ee0b4494cbcea1b600d98b7e7
msgid ""
"`NEP 数据集查看 → 打开文件…` 的 `Advanced / experimental structure files` 筛选器 还会显示 "
"CP2K 输出与 n2p2 `input.data`。这两个入口按文件内容识别格式，不会只因为扩展名 匹配就把损坏文件当成有效数据。"
msgstr ""
"The `Advanced / experimental structure files` filter under `NEP Dataset "
"Display → Open File…` also exposes CP2K output and n2p2 `input.data`. "
"Both importers identify the format from file contents; a matching "
"extension alone does not make a damaged file valid."

#: ../../source/formats.md:86 37d4215c3214485781f9bb2ad4134743
msgid "CP2K 单点输出"
msgstr "CP2K single-point output"

#: ../../source/formats.md:88 517ac9a0dfd84a3880219d8e98df6f9b
msgid "支持带 CP2K 签名的 `.out` / `.log` 主输出。"
msgstr "Main `.out` / `.log` files containing a CP2K signature are supported."

#: ../../source/formats.md:89 f5dc8089f43049a78c678b642c14afab
msgid "当前入口只支持包含一组坐标和一组力的三维周期单点输出；优化或 MD 的多步历史应先转换为 EXTXYZ，不能直接把多个坐标块拼成一个结构。"
msgstr ""
"This entry point currently supports only three-dimensional periodic "
"single-point output containing one coordinate block and one force block. "
"Convert multi-step optimization or MD histories to EXTXYZ first; multiple"
" coordinate blocks are never concatenated into one structure."

#: ../../source/formats.md:91 858596efc8674fbcb4feea909c3980cd
msgid ""
"读取 `CELL| Vector a/b/c [angstrom]`、`MODULE QUICKSTEP: ATOMIC COORDINATES "
"IN ANGSTROM`、Hartree 能量、原子单位力和 GPa stress，并转换到 eV、Å 和 eV/Å³。"
msgstr ""
"The importer reads `CELL| Vector a/b/c [angstrom]`, `MODULE QUICKSTEP: "
"ATOMIC COORDINATES IN ANGSTROM`, Hartree energy, forces in atomic units, "
"and stress in GPa, then converts them to eV, Å, and eV/Å³."

#: ../../source/formats.md:94 58f7956951cd4b03b9e37c1110b6b70f
msgid "缺少完整 cell、没有坐标、力数量不一致、cell 退化或含多个坐标/力块时会明确失败。"
msgstr ""
"Import fails explicitly when the complete cell or coordinates are "
"missing, the force count does not match, the cell is degenerate, or "
"multiple coordinate or force blocks are present."

#: ../../source/formats.md:95 a194d73ca513475e955b74f9346514f2
msgid ""
"当前 CP2K 主输出入口记录 `pbc=\"T T T\"`，因此不要用于 `PERIODIC NONE` 或部分周期计算。 这类计算应从 "
"CP2K 导出带明确 `Lattice` 和 `pbc` 的 EXTXYZ 后再导入。"
msgstr ""
"The current CP2K main-output entry point records `pbc=\"T T T\"`; do not "
"use it for `PERIODIC NONE` or partially periodic calculations. Export "
"those calculations from CP2K as EXTXYZ with explicit `Lattice` and `pbc`,"
" then import that file."

#: ../../source/formats.md:98 5a5ae37f1d1b4fd68aabc8d4a930f7e8
msgid "CP2K 的几何优化文档也建议使用轨迹或最终结构文件承载多步几何；主输出并不是完整轨迹容器。"
msgstr ""
"The CP2K geometry-optimization documentation likewise recommends "
"trajectory or final-structure files for multi-step geometries; the main "
"output is not a complete trajectory container."

#: ../../source/formats.md:100 bfa214603bef4d6e9270bd029c288c2d
msgid "n2p2 `input.data`"
msgstr "n2p2 `input.data`"

#: ../../source/formats.md:102 8931f11bc67345df989a4e3430bfff89
msgid "支持名为 `input.data` 的文件以及 `.data` / `.cfg` 文件。"
msgstr ""
"Files named `input.data` and files with `.data` or `.cfg` extensions are "
"supported."

#: ../../source/formats.md:103 eba0b1e5fd784ad0abc5868b30adb252
msgid "结构块必须由 `begin` / `end` 完整包围；每个 atom 行严格包含位置、元素、电荷、逐原子能量 和三维力。"
msgstr ""
"Every structure block must be enclosed by `begin` and `end`. Each atom "
"row must contain position, element, charge, per-atom energy, and a three-"
"dimensional force."

#: ../../source/formats.md:105 39a6ab31ebe54963a0a239e71687f275
msgid "n2p2 CFG 数值按 Bohr / Hartree 读取，并转换为 Å、eV 和 eV/Å。"
msgstr ""
"n2p2 CFG values are read in Bohr and Hartree, then converted to Å, eV, "
"and eV/Å."

#: ../../source/formats.md:106 a43f5135b0134617a507b3f79f258134
#
msgid "0 或 3 行 lattice 都是合法格式；只有 1–2 行 lattice、损坏数值、非法元素或缺少 `end` 会使整次导入失败。"
msgstr "Either zero or three lattice rows form a valid format. One or two lattice rows, damaged numeric values, invalid elements, or a missing `end` marker cause the entire import to fail."

#: ../../source/formats.md:109 5d64dbc1245b4cd9a21d65bbf952ae98
msgid "LAMMPS"
msgstr "LAMMPS"

#: ../../source/formats.md:111 db66ffc30c1344bb89bae484b0b5f572
msgid "`dump`"
msgstr "`dump`"

#: ../../source/formats.md:112 cd379181f355400e81c4c245bda008fd
msgid "`lammpstrj`"
msgstr "`lammpstrj`"

#: ../../source/formats.md:114 6518c60090264dcaa24955f26ee68707
msgid ""
"支持正交和三斜晶胞，以及常见坐标列。导入后建议先抽查晶胞、元素类型和坐标单位是否符合预期。 每一帧必须包含完整的 `BOX BOUNDS` "
"边界标志、一个完整坐标三元组（`xs/ys/zs`、 `x/y/z` 或 `xu/yu/zu`）以及 `element` 或 `type` "
"列。仅有数值 `type` 时，需要由导入 界面或调用方提供完整的“类型编号 → 元素”映射；NepTrainKit 不会把未知类型替换成伪元素。"
" 原子行截断、非法元素、缺失映射或退化晶胞都会使整次导入明确失败，不会返回不完整轨迹。"
msgstr ""
"Orthogonal and triclinic cells and the common coordinate columns are "
"supported. After import, spot-check the cell, element types, and "
"coordinate units. Every frame must provide complete `BOX BOUNDS` boundary"
" flags, one complete coordinate triplet (`xs/ys/zs`, `x/y/z`, or "
"`xu/yu/zu`), and an `element` or `type` column. A dump containing only "
"numeric `type` values requires a complete type-number-to-element mapping "
"from the import UI or caller; NepTrainKit never substitutes pseudo-"
"elements for unknown types. Truncated atom rows, invalid elements, "
"missing mappings, or degenerate cells fail the entire import instead of "
"returning a partial trajectory."

#: ../../source/formats.md:120 0d282a4097224e7cab9fe541bbe02873
msgid "带自旋的推荐 dump"
msgstr "Recommended dump format with spins"

#: ../../source/formats.md:122 55ae2dde27b14343963dd5cc1f2e1997
msgid "使用 spin LAMMPS 时，推荐按下面的列名输出磁矩："
msgstr ""
"When using spin LAMMPS, use the following column names to output magnetic"
" moments:"

#: ../../source/formats.md:124 cfe2006ecd824cfa850551537cf4609b
msgid ""
"compute spin all property/atom sp spx spy spz fmx fmy fmz fx fy fz\n"
"dump dpgen_dump all custom 100 traj.dump id type x y z c_spin[1] "
"c_spin[2] c_spin[3] c_spin[4] c_spin[5] c_spin[6] c_spin[7]\n"
msgstr ""
"compute spin all property/atom sp spx spy spz fmx fmy fmz fx fy fz\n"
"dump dpgen_dump all custom 100 traj.dump id type x y z c_spin[1] "
"c_spin[2] c_spin[3] c_spin[4] c_spin[5] c_spin[6] c_spin[7]\n"

#: ../../source/formats.md:129 7768b388eb2b4c17b7d81c65cf85f2d8
msgid ""
"导入器把 `c_spin[1]` 解释为磁矩模长，把 `c_spin[2]`、`c_spin[3]`、`c_spin[4]` "
"解释为三个方向分量，并重建逐原子自旋向量："
msgstr ""
"The importer treats `c_spin[1]` as the moment magnitude and `c_spin[2]`, "
"`c_spin[3]`, and `c_spin[4]` as the three direction components, then "
"reconstructs the per-atom spin vector:"

#: ../../source/formats.md:131 3323d1c85f45443c895ff748a1745c06
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf s_i=c_{\\mathrm{spin}[1]}\n"
"\\left(c_{\\mathrm{spin}[2]},c_{\\mathrm{spin}[3]},c_{\\mathrm{spin}[4]}\\right)."
"\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf s_i=c_{\\mathrm{spin}[1]}\n"
"\\left(c_{\\mathrm{spin}[2]},c_{\\mathrm{spin}[3]},c_{\\mathrm{spin}[4]}\\right)."
"\n"

#: ../../source/formats.md:136 d22bb9427d0c40dbbdeb45e3e6b46dd7
msgid ""
"`c_spin[5]`、`c_spin[6]`、`c_spin[7]` 是磁力分量，不会写入 `spin:R:3`。如果缺少 "
"`c_spin[1:4]` 中任意一列，导入器不会为该帧生成自旋字段。"
msgstr ""
"`c_spin[5]`, `c_spin[6]`, and `c_spin[7]` are magnetic-force components "
"and are not written to `spin:R:3`. If any column in `c_spin[1:4]` is "
"missing, the importer does not create a spin field for that frame."

#: ../../source/formats.md:138 2cecb5e8d2ac493eb1902430d41186aa
msgid "导出"
msgstr "Export"

#: ../../source/formats.md:140 9c952ffc74854f27997b72272e95a319
msgid "`NEP 数据集查看` 可以把当前数据导出为两类结果："
msgstr "`NEP Dataset Display` can export the current data in two main forms:"

#: ../../source/formats.md:142 15e4fc03c7904805a6740adaa153577b
msgid "`xyz` / `extxyz`：适合继续回到 GPUMD、ASE 或构建数据集流程。"
msgstr ""
"`xyz` / `extxyz`: suitable for returning to a GPUMD, ASE, or Make Dataset"
" workflow."

#: ../../source/formats.md:143 09aa19b5563649e6a71e7d0c045542b3
msgid "`DeepMD NPY`：标准 `deepmd/npy`。在导出弹窗中选择按 `Config_type` 或按化学式建立子目录。"
msgstr ""
"`DeepMD NPY`: standard `deepmd/npy`. In the export dialog, choose whether"
" to create subdirectories by `Config_type` or by chemical formula."

#: ../../source/formats.md:144 fc456704c87b4f7ea2714fb100269743
msgid ""
"`DeepMD NPY (Mixed)`：把化学式可以不同的帧写入逐帧 `real_atom_types.npy`。弹窗中的“虚拟原子填充”与 "
"dpdata 的 `atom_numb_pad` 一致：`0` "
"按精确原子数分目录；正整数会把原子数向上补到该数的倍数，使不同原子数的体系能够合并。补位类型为 `-1`，重新读取时会自动移除。"
msgstr ""
"`DeepMD NPY (Mixed)`: writes frames with potentially different chemical "
"formulas using per-frame `real_atom_types.npy`. `Virtual-atom padding` in"
" the dialog matches dpdata's `atom_numb_pad`: `0` creates directories by "
"exact atom count; a positive integer rounds atom counts up to a multiple "
"of that value, allowing systems with different atom counts to be "
"combined. Padding uses type `-1` and is removed automatically when the "
"data is read again."

#: ../../source/formats.md:146 50946981b8914153b48957c8a9b74292
msgid ""
"标准 NPY 选择按 `Config_type` 分组时，同一 `Config_type` 下的结构必须具有一致的元素与 "
"原子数、PBC、逐原子字段和能量/virial 覆盖；一个 `Config_type` 包含多种化学式时应改选 按化学式分组，或改用 "
"Mixed。Mixed 按填充后的原子数聚合，同一目录内仍必须具有一致的 PBC、 逐原子字段和标签覆盖。"
msgstr ""
"When standard NPY is grouped by `Config_type`, structures within one "
"`Config_type` must have consistent elements and atom counts, PBC, per-"
"atom fields, and energy/virial coverage. If one `Config_type` contains "
"several chemical formulas, group by formula or use Mixed instead. Mixed "
"aggregates by padded atom count; structures within one directory must "
"still have consistent PBC, per-atom fields, and label coverage."

#: ../../source/formats.md:151 c88ca261a7fb4cbd9ff7a86dd98563c4
msgid ""
"两种 NPY 都保留全周期或全非周期 PBC；全非周期目录写入 `nopbc`。部分周期边界无法表示， "
"导出会在写文件前失败。填充值越大，能够合并的原子数越多，但坐标和逐原子数组也会更大；例如最大原子数为 64 时，填充值 64 可合为一个目录。标准"
" NPY 会按 `type_map` 重排原子及其逐原子字段；Mixed 保持每帧 原子顺序，并用 `real_atom_types.npy` "
"保存对应元素类型。"
msgstr ""
"Both NPY formats preserve fully periodic or fully nonperiodic PBC; a "
"fully nonperiodic directory contains `nopbc`. Partially periodic "
"boundaries cannot be represented, so export fails before writing files. "
"Larger padding values combine a wider range of atom counts but also "
"enlarge coordinate and per-atom arrays. For example, when the maximum "
"atom count is 64, a padding value of 64 can combine the data into one "
"directory. Standard NPY reorders atoms and their per-atom fields "
"according to `type_map`; Mixed preserves each frame's atom order and "
"records the corresponding element types in `real_atom_types.npy`."

#: ../../source/formats.md:155 9ac6a0fa6005455a9c3bce9db2cd5d0b
msgid "大数据和导入说明"
msgstr "Large datasets and import behavior"

#: ../../source/formats.md:157 bd896fc5df26455a918f73b562b7ee0b
msgid "大数据集导入时，界面显示可能做抽样或延迟渲染；底层选择和导出仍以完整数据为准。"
msgstr ""
"For a large dataset, the interface may sample or defer rendering for "
"responsiveness. Selection and export still operate on the complete "
"dataset."

#: ../../source/formats.md:158 100c78a73f074f0abf23d571b234e972
msgid "导入过程支持中断。"
msgstr "You can cancel an import while it is running."

#: ../../source/formats.md:159 e661461e36344eb79d49d7a26fb14de3
msgid ""
"不同来源的文件最好保留清晰命名，例如 "
"`candidate_pool.xyz`、`candidate_pool_clean.xyz`、`dft_labeled.xyz`。"
msgstr ""
"Use descriptive names for files from different stages, such as "
"`candidate_pool.xyz`, `candidate_pool_clean.xyz`, and `dft_labeled.xyz`."

